WEBVTT

00:02:58.848 --> 00:03:00.203
Retko kad imam temu.

00:03:00.865 --> 00:03:03.169
Pronalazim prelepe stvari
iz svih delova sveta,

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:06.021
i postavljam ih na 3D tapiserije

00:03:06.045 --> 00:03:08.705
preko osnovnog sloja
koji mi pokriva celo telo -

00:03:08.729 --> 00:03:10.800
zato što nisam zadovoljan svojim telom.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.154
(Smeh)

00:03:12.177 --> 00:03:14.177
Pitam sebe: „Da li treba nešto da skinem

00:03:14.201 --> 00:03:16.395
ili da stavim nešto?

00:03:16.419 --> 00:03:17.592
Možda 100 komada?”

00:03:17.616 --> 00:03:19.062
Nekada to i uradim.

00:03:20.963 --> 00:03:23.767
Garantujem vam da nije suviše neudobno -

00:03:23.791 --> 00:03:25.333
pa, samo malkice -

00:03:25.357 --> 00:03:26.437
(Smeh)

00:03:26.461 --> 00:03:28.700
Možda me ponekad ubode ziherica

00:03:28.724 --> 00:03:30.629
dok pričam sa vama,